<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Vainly they watch His bed—</l><l>Jesus, my Savior!</l><l>Vainly they seal the dead—</l><l>Jesus my Lord!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Death cannot keep his prey—</l><l>Jesus, my Savior!</l><l>He tore the bars away—</l><l>Jesus my Lord!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
